{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S07、S11、S13等短段里感受提示仍然偏密，而且压缩了部分关键心理转折，尤其是反事实犹疑和即使没有人陪伴也要好好生活的最终态度。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把每段叙述的核心落在醒目的关键词上，感受又按音乐节点出现，边听边扫更容易抓住情绪变化，也更容易把音乐的细节和人物的心理联系起来。X在人物动机的完整解释上略胜，尤其保留了早知如此是否还会离开的反事实犹疑，以及即使没有人陪伴也要好好生活的结尾含义。总体而言，Y的阅读引导、音乐同步和感受层次更好，虽然局部存在信息过密和叙事压缩的问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "90604afa-5711-4fb1-80ef-3e8604b65df9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T220808452344Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:08:51.720177+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3733b76cddd27eafd3ab4abd2aee45c559dd897006ea74146938b83025e5563d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we